{% raw %}<section class="band band-photo"><img src="/images/2018/06/Cabinetry_Header-hero.webp" alt="All Wood Cabinets" width="1200" height="900" fetchpriority="high" class="band-img"></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h1>Smart. Stylish. Diamond Cabinets</h1><h2>From Singer Kitchens with Showrooms in New Orleans &amp; Mandeville</h2><div class="el-text"><p>If you’re considering replacing your kitchen cabinets or even a full kitchen renovation, you simply HAVE To see the Diamond Cabinet line at Singer Kitchens with showrooms in New Orleans and Mandeville, LA.</p><p>Featuring stylish and innovative ways to add more storage to your kitchen, Diamond Cabinets stands out as one of our favorite brands. Let’s take a look at how Diamond Cabinets can completely transform your kitchen from drab to dazzling.</p></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>The Diamond-Standard Of Cabinetry</h2><div class="el-text"><p>The Diamond approach is simple: Don’t just think different–think smarter. Diamond is all about thinking inside the box, finding creative ways to get more out of every kitchen or bathroom cabinet. More space. More accessibility.</p><p>Looking for an extra helping of style? The Diamond Vibe series of cabinetry is designed to fit into your unique remodeling plans. Choose from the freshest finishes and door styles, along with organizational solutions that put everyday essentials within easy reach.</p><p>From eye-catching finishes and colors, to oh-so-stylish storage options, to the most well-executed basics–you can always count on Diamond to deliver the look you want, the quality you expect, and a range of prices to satisfy.</p></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Trendy Yet Timeless</h2><div class="el-text"><p>If you’re looking for the latest trends and styles for your kitchen cabinets, then you’ve found the right brand! As a leading cabinet company, Diamond offers a beautiful selection of designer-inspired colors and perfectly stylish stains, as well as specialty finishes and glazes. Whether you’re styling your kitchen as a bold, modern conversation starter or as the traditional, cozy heart of your home, you’ll find exactly the style, build, and colors to spark your creativity and bring your kitchen remodel to life.</p></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Innovative Storage Built Around YOUR Life</h2><div class="el-text"><p>As a leader in the cabinet industry, Diamond offers next-level kitchen cabinetry, with storage and organization products that will make your next home project as functional as it is fashionable! Create an organization system that works with your needs with several customizable organization solutions built right into your cabinets and drawers!</p><p>Don’t settle for a cookie-cutter, “standard” kitchen with cavernous drawers and cabinetry. With Diamond, you can truly make your kitchen YOUR space, and make every meal time prep into a breeze.</p></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Environmentally-Conscious Cabinetry</h2><div class="el-text"><p>As a certified member of the Kitchen Cabinet Manufacturers Association's (KCMA) Environmental Stewardship Program, Diamond demonstrates an ongoing commitment to sustainability. Diamond goes above and beyond minimum industry requirements to ensure the safety and health of the environment, and they demonstrate leadership in a growing area of concern and importance. With eco-friendly sourcing and manufacturing, Diamond is continuously working to preserve and protect the world around us.</p></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Diamond Vibe: The Essence of Style</h2><div class="el-text"><p>You shouldn’t limit yourself to just one style, and Diamond doesn’t either. If you’re looking for something more on the stylish side, the Diamond® Vibe™ series offers mainstream fashion and must-have features to suit your space with style. With clean lines and simple designs, the Diamond Vibe series strikes a fine balance between traditional and modern styles. And, best of all, there’s no sacrificing space or function for style; you’ll find everything you want, and more, in the Diamond Vibe series. </p></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Ready For A Remodel?</h2><div class="el-text"><p>Ready to make your kitchen the jewel of your home? We’re ready to make it happen.</p><p>Call us today in New Orleans or Mandevbille to see the Diamond Cabinet line or to get a free estimate on your remodeling, and we’ll take care of finding all the dazzling details your kitchen–and you–deserve.</p></div></div></section>{% endraw %}
